        <activityName xml:lang="en">Anode, graphite, for Li-ion battery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Anode, graphite, for Li-ion battery
Data is taken from recent literature on EV battery production along with its components; UUID: d3ced172-d5e0-35b6-a68a-8e3c55a87c34
This dataset represents the production of 1 kg graphite-based anode for Li-ion batteries. Data are based on literature and expert judgement. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset ""chemical factory, organics"" is accounted. This dataset is a copy of the corresponding regional dataset. Production volume was adjusted.
Location: Data for global graphite based anodes in the world
Technology: Anode for Lithium ion batteries.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d3ced172-d5e0-35b6-a68a-8e3c55a87c34.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
